No whitespace pass: IDE0055 is off in the settings, so no whitespace formatting: style and analyzer fixes only.
Held back: IDE0049: this .NET SDK's 'dotnet format' ignores the suppressor StyleBro's multi-target guard uses for IDE rules, so their fixes could write C# or APIs that another target framework or project compiling the same file doesn't have. They aren't applied here; a newer .NET SDK's 'dotnet format' applies them where the guard allows.
Multi-targeted: one 'dotnet format' run per target framework (net461, net6.0, netstandard2.0). net472, net48: no run of their own, the code compiles the same as for another framework of the same kind (the same '#if' symbols tested, files and settings).
